[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Northeast Philadelphia separate sanitary sewer system: demo model
Bustleton collection system -> Pennypack Creek interceptor -> Delaware interceptor -> Northeast WPCP (Bridesburg).
Streets, parcels and creek: City of Philadelphia open data. Ground: USGS 3DEP lidar. Plant site: PWD parcel, 3899 Richmond St.
Pipes, pump stations, basin and flows are ASSUMED for the demo; this is not PWD's system.
Holmesburg, Tacony and Mayfair join as lumped trunks. Storm: NOAA Atlas 14 2-year 24-hour (3.26 in), NRCS Type II.
Scenario: Bustleton sewers lined and laterals repaired (Bustleton RDII 40 % lower).

